  "passages": {
    "reading_B": "Welcome to the Macizo Route! Tomorrow, we are going to hike the trail in the morning, and in the afternoon, we are going to visit a coffee farm. Yesterday it rained and the trail was muddy, but today the weather is better. If you like taking photos, you are going to love the sunrise walk. Breakfast is at 7:00 a.m.",
